### 东信和平仓库库位Excel导入测试
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090

### 1. 上传Excel批量导入仓库库位
### Excel表头支持：仓库编码 / warehouse_code / warehouseCode，库位ID / location_id / locationId / 库位id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/location/warehouse-location/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=warehouse-location-boundary

--warehouse-location-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="warehouse-location.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./warehouse-location.xlsx
--warehouse-location-boundary--
